{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:27:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_e9a1036f5d484555b51b691904b4ff8b","id":"pg_a5652a74289d510599befcd4b1e3c0d7","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/opendev-to-opendev-roadmap-md-d32c660e4eed-fcd4b1e3c0d7.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_9f077a69888959f3883a72fad5d69edd"],"title":"opendev-to/opendev/ROADMAP.md @ d32c660e4eed","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:27:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e9a1036f5d484555b51b691904b4ff8b"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_2d92d54e1bfa222b4c19531557432f09070ab955ecaea84b3cded9bc16061d1e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The adaptation document indicates that before this work OpenDev lacked background agents, inter-agent communication, teams, and worktree isolation, suggesting these multi-agent capabilities are recent additions whose shipped status should be verified against code."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4a036e3fd12f5f820c20bda1de179af88b26e18466b98ba789a5d1ca8f6622c2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Per-agent sidechain transcripts are stored as append-only JSONL at `~/.opendev/sessions/{session_id}/agents/{agent_id}.jsonl`, with readers that filter malformed lines and orphaned tool calls for resume."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4be6dda976e36c638f39a11f9cbb51907212a6cd5dbe269efe3e4f4de1989042"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A WorktreeManager creates git worktrees per agent (branch `opendev/agent-{short_id}`), detects changes, and removes clean worktrees while preserving dirty ones for review."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5311f4defdac0b9aa5585ce7580bda67b36fcaf7da683781a35d43a68074b1a6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The design doc specifies a TaskManager in opendev-runtime: a UI-agnostic task lifecycle state machine with idempotent transitions, a notified flag, 5-second eviction grace, and retain-to-block-eviction."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5ef3258e920f6d4f26c73241dd365762485d0daf361f457820279bbaa4b492f8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A file-based mailbox system gives each agent an inbox with fd-lock protocol, corruption recovery via rename, a 1000-entry cap, and message types including Text, ShutdownRequest, ShutdownResponse, and Idle."},{"claim_ids":["clm_69a59e544af4ec3feac0eff2c0f1723abb9883b424d2764fbce30d77686750c1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A `run_in_background` parameter on `spawn_subagent` returns a task_id immediately, runs the agent in a detached tokio task, and injects results into the parent via a sentinel mechanism when idle."}],"claim_ids":["clm_2d92d54e1bfa222b4c19531557432f09070ab955ecaea84b3cded9bc16061d1e","clm_4a036e3fd12f5f820c20bda1de179af88b26e18466b98ba789a5d1ca8f6622c2","clm_4be6dda976e36c638f39a11f9cbb51907212a6cd5dbe269efe3e4f4de1989042","clm_5311f4defdac0b9aa5585ce7580bda67b36fcaf7da683781a35d43a68074b1a6","clm_5ef3258e920f6d4f26c73241dd365762485d0daf361f457820279bbaa4b492f8","clm_69a59e544af4ec3feac0eff2c0f1723abb9883b424d2764fbce30d77686750c1"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:27:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_e9a1036f5d484555b51b691904b4ff8b","id":"pg_a7d8169f351a54239021b6112b1d71f1","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/opendev-to-opendev-docs-agent-framework-adaptation-md-d32c660e4eed-b6112b1d71f1.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_e62a0f140c195ff18f1a3c740c59bbb3"],"title":"opendev-to/opendev/docs/agent-framework-adaptation.md @ d32c660e4eed","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:27:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e9a1036f5d484555b51b691904b4ff8b"}
